  <item>
    <title>EP. 04 来了我的书店，都要白白干干的呀！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66538f6cc59d1e5757d60699</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66538f6cc59d1e5757d60699</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2024 19:37:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客的录制时间，是在秃子公开在小红书招白干实习之前，本身只是想和宜家老师吐槽一下这段经历，开始并没有想作为锤秃子的辅助材料，所以整集博客的氛围也是偏轻松幽默，瓜也是我想到哪个说到哪个，如果喜欢非常有条理的叙述的朋友们，请小小等待一下pdf文字版！</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本期show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 芸昕是如何当上冤大头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 我们是如何谈薪资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 本想淡淡退出，结果几百块都不给我？ 开撕！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 从不下凡的仙男，你自己的店你要不要来看一眼呀？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2067">34:27</a> 秃男占便宜之让剧组给他免费打扫卫生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 开始了开始了，他又开始演了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> &nbsp;秃子又又 又开始指点江山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3273">54:33</a> 秃子：“这谁给我报的名啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3396">56:36</a> &nbsp;他的经济能力=3M胶对半剪开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3663">01:01:03</a> &nbsp;他的春秋大梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4019">01:06:59</a> &nbsp;虚假的女性主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">01:09:50</a> &nbsp;蹭！他就爱蹭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4355">01:12:35</a> 名人名言之：你们不用把我当老板，但我自己把我自己当老板！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4702">01:18:22</a> 撕到他抱头鼠窜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4867">01:21:07</a> 课后总结，划重点，以及芸昕的预言家发言</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llHiWhdtnJSv-axS27gehXY41QY2.m4a" length="161086047" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:24</itunes:duration>
