  <item>
    <title>EP. 03 被“女性主义”创飞？跳个舞也成媚男了吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66305b88485813145068b151</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66305b88485813145068b151</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Apr 2024 02:46:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>当主播芸昕兴冲冲报名了舞室的Magnetic新课时……课程竟然因为该mv不够女权而被取消了！现今韩团风格的热舞和女权无法相融吗？想追求美丽性感也会是迎合男性凝视吗？走调垫台对此有话说……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">3:59</a> Magnetic犯下的“几大罪状”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> 未成年可以谈“性”吗？可以性感吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a>0化妆是美丽税吗？我想变得好看是迎合男凝吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3249">54:09</a> 我们为什么爱看东北雨姐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>p.s. 本期芸昕的猫猫也有“性感出镜”，敬请期待</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkr8f9li7JogJmIp9s_LY9rB3O3l.m4a" length="71363022" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsyk4U7ATgEY66YqQltrdqo4jA_Y.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
